── PARAMETER TYPE THAT CAN'T BE GENERATED ── E0333_parameter_type_that_can_t_be_generated.lt:2:15  [E0333]

Values of `fn(i64) -> i64` can't be generated: it is a function type:

  2 │ /// prop: |f: fn(i64) -> i64, x: i64| twice(f, x) == f(f(x))
    │               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

`stilt test` can't generate functions, values of a type that has none, or maps
whose keys aren't `Eq` and `Hash`. Take values that it can generate, and build
the rest inside the property.
